{
  "story": {
    "intro": "Founded by Jeff Payne in 1999 (yup, the century before this one), Eleven is a boutique audio post-production studio in West Los Angeles, CA. Our thing is mix, sound design, voiceover, ADR, music, voice casting as well as being known as good hangs. The name Eleven… let’s just say it’s an homage to Spinal Tap. Not familiar? Stop by Google.",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "text": "In 2022, after 24 years in Santa Monica, Jeff and partner Jordan Meltzer bought a building in West LA and built three brand spanking new studios from scratch.{01} The design vision for the facility was that it feel like a fine 5-star hotel but without the beds. Cuz that would be weird.",
        "note": {
          "n": "01",
          "text": " The original plan was to build and open America’s largest [[Hot Dog-On-A-Stick]] franchise. Legal squabbles arose with the HDOAS overlords, so we settled for 3 primo studios.",
          "photo": {
            "src": "/media/about/hot-dog-on-a-stick.webp",
            "alt": "A Hot Dog on a Stick stand with its crew in the striped uniforms and hats",
            "width": 960,
            "height": 640
          }
        },
        "width": 1147
      },
      {
        "text": "Over the years we’ve worked on just about every brand known in the vast ad industry universe.{02} We take sound very seriously. Everything else, well, we’re still working on.",
        "note": {
          "n": "02",
          "text": "Yes, we know. Bragging. Those marketing tools made us put it here."
        },
        "width": 922
      }
    ],
    "sticker": {
      "src": "/media/about/ointment-light.webp",
      "width": 254.027,
      "height": 108.909
    },
    "globe": {
      "src": "/media/about/snow-globe.webp",
      "width": 671.621,
      "height": 515.849,
      "note": {
        "n": "03",
        "text": "The old Santa Monica studio, where it all started in 1999. Long gone, never forgotten."
      }
    }
